# src/ conventions

- Data (pizzas, menu, ICON/ES) lives in `src/data/` — UI modes import it; don't duplicate charts.
- Shared UI: `src/components/`. Study modes: `src/modes/`.
- Themes/tokens: `src/theme.js`. Storage/audio helpers: `src/lib/`.
- Prefer inline styles + existing theme tokens over new CSS frameworks.
- When adding a pizza: update `PIZZAS`, verify `sec`/`afterCut`, both sizes `"10"` and `"14"`.
- Keep `estudio-pizzas.jsx` as a thin re-export of `App` if external imports still point there.
